            <ArticleTitle>[The evaluation of the efficacy of obzidan and sydnopharm in patients with stenocardia of effort].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>83-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>It is concluded that obsidane and sidnopharm were effective in the treatment of patients with exertion stenocardia in outpatients conditions. The patients continued to work. Obsidane treatment was most effective in patients with the hyperkinetic type of circulation, increased blood viscosity and hypercoagulation syndrome.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
